        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:14px 0 0">As AI agents start moving money on people's behalf, someone has to be the guardrail at the moment money leaves. We're that layer — embeddable fraud detection, plain-English explanations, and a confirm-before-you-send checkpoint.</p>
